---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Typical direction of effect on seven groups of stocks from rising rates, a weaker dong and a slower economy.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Which groups feel which force (typical direction, not a rule)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhóm nào chịu lực nào (chiều thường gặp, không phải quy luật)</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="44" width="860" height="34" rx="6" class="card" />
      <text x="330" y="66" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Rates up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lãi suất tăng</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="66" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Weaker dong</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đồng yếu đi</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="66" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Slower economy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kinh tế chậm lại</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="82" width="860" height="32" rx="4" class="card" opacity="0.55" />
      <text x="34" y="102" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Banks</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ngân hàng</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="102" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="102" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="102" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="34" y="136" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Property developers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất động sản</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="136" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="136" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="136" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="150" width="860" height="32" rx="4" class="card" opacity="0.55" />
      <text x="34" y="170" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Brokers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Công ty chứng khoán</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="170" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="170" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="170" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="34" y="204" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Exporters</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xuất khẩu</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="204" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="204" class="grn" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Helps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="204" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="218" width="860" height="32" rx="4" class="card" opacity="0.55" />
      <text x="34" y="238" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Importers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nhập khẩu</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="238" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="238" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="238" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="34" y="272" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Steel, commodities</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thép, hàng hóa</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="272" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="272" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="272" class="red" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Hurts</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất lợi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="286" width="860" height="32" rx="4" class="card" opacity="0.55" />
      <text x="34" y="306" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Staples, utilities</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hàng thiết yếu, tiện ích</tspan></text>
      <text x="330" y="306" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="520" y="306" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
      <text x="710" y="306" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Mixed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hai chiều</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A reading aid built from the mechanisms in this post, not data. "Mixed" means the sign depends on the company: a bank earns more on loans but carries more bad-debt risk; an exporter gains on revenue but may owe USD.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Bảng gợi ý đọc, dựng từ các cơ chế trong bài, không phải số liệu. "Hai chiều" nghĩa là dấu phụ thuộc từng công ty: ngân hàng thu lãi vay nhiều hơn nhưng nợ xấu rủi ro hơn; nhà xuất khẩu lời ở doanh thu nhưng có thể nợ USD.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08sectorsensitivity figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
